@baseUrl = https://localhost:7270
@customerToken = REPLACE_WITH_CUSTOMER_APPLICATION_TOKEN
@staffToken = REPLACE_WITH_DELEGATED_STAFF_TOKEN
@session = session:aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
@applicationId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@documentId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
@version = 1
@submissionKey = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333

### Draft reads and creation return `version`. Before each mutation, replace
### @version with the latest value from a GET. A missing or malformed header
### returns 400; a stale edit returns 409 with type urn:pd-mortgages:concurrency-conflict.
### Successful edits may advance the version; GET again before the next edit.

### Create a customer draft
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mortgages
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
X-Mortgage-Session: {{session}}

### Read a customer draft
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mortgages/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
X-Mortgage-Session: {{session}}

### Create a staff draft
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mortgages/staff
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Search applications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mortgages/staff?page=1&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Read an application as staff
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mortgages/staff/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Read audit history as staff
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mortgages/staff/{{applicationId}}/audit?page=1&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### Save property and deposit
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mortgages/{{applicationId}}/qualification
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
X-Mortgage-Session: {{session}}
X-Expected-Version: {{version}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"propertyValue":300000,"deposit":30000}

### Save applicant
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mortgages/{{applicationId}}/applicant
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
X-Mortgage-Session: {{session}}
X-Expected-Version: {{version}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Jane","lastName":"Doe","email":"jane@example.com","phoneNumber":"07123456789"}

### Save finances
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mortgages/{{applicationId}}/finances
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
X-Mortgage-Session: {{session}}
X-Expected-Version: {{version}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"annualIncome":100000,"monthlyCommitments":1000,"employmentType":"Employed"}

### Record consents
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mortgages/{{applicationId}}/consents
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
X-Mortgage-Session: {{session}}
X-Expected-Version: {{version}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"creditCheckConsent":false}

### Generate a decision in principle
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mortgages/{{applicationId}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
X-Mortgage-Session: {{session}}
X-Expected-Version: {{version}}

### List products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mortgages/products
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
X-Mortgage-Session: {{session}}

### List eligible products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mortgages/{{applicationId}}/eligible-products
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
X-Mortgage-Session: {{session}}

### Read a product
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mortgages/products/fixed-2
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
X-Mortgage-Session: {{session}}

### Select a product
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mortgages/{{applicationId}}/product
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
X-Mortgage-Session: {{session}}
X-Expected-Version: {{version}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId":"fixed-2"}

### Attach a PDF (contents are base64)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mortgages/{{applicationId}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
X-Mortgage-Session: {{session}}
X-Expected-Version: {{version}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fileName":"example.pdf","contents":"JVBERi0xLjc="}

### Download an attached document
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mortgages/{{applicationId}}/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
X-Mortgage-Session: {{session}}

### Submit the customer draft; retry with the same version and key.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mortgages/{{applicationId}}/customer-submission
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
X-Mortgage-Session: {{session}}
X-Expected-Version: {{version}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"submissionKey":"{{submissionKey}}"}

### Retrieve only the short-lived receipt in the same customer session
### An unavailable receipt returns 404 with type urn:pd-mortgages:receipt-not-found.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mortgages/{{applicationId}}/submission-receipt
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
X-Mortgage-Session: {{session}}
X-Submission-Key: {{submissionKey}}

### Check the configured product catalog and service credential (internal API)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/dependencies

### Submit as staff
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mortgages/{{applicationId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
X-Expected-Version: {{version}}

### Delete an in-progress draft
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/mortgages/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
X-Mortgage-Session: {{session}}
X-Expected-Version: {{version}}
